observed   = "The loop's readers and signers are not in the kernel image: SEND construction and balance reads exist only in layerx-node-probe (write-send, balance, did-accounts), the credit signer is build/tests/bridge/sign-credit driven by tests/daemon/withdraw-custody.py against an owned paxd chain, and the only activity-to-batch reader is /v1/authorized-batches/by-activity of layerx-receipt-authority, which the init does not run until task 2.1; the ruling on observation 1.6.2 did not name the read interface."
assumption = "Intended shape once ruled: the image (task 1.5 touches) carries layerx-node-probe and sign-credit, value-loop.sh generates the two seeds under /data/layerx/keys, credits the treasury, treasury SENDs to A, A SENDs to B, balances via probe balance, batch via the receipt authority by-activity route after task 2.1, statusOf on 0x...1014; the subcommand stops on the absent genesis ids file or publication policy with one precondition line."
severity   = "blocker"

[observation.1.6.5]
